I am not doing any url syncs. I am normally getting the slugs from `this.props.params.slug` to find slug and use this in instantsearch like this in my `render()`

```jsx
<InstantSearch appId={ALGOLIA_APPID}
                apiKey={ALGOLIA_APIKEY}
                indexName={LOWESTINDEX}
                searchParameters={{
                    distinct: false,
                    filters: `slug: ${slug} AND instock: 1`
                }}>
```

When this slug changes, I need to get the new slug.

```jsx
componentWillReceiveProps(nextProps) {
    if(this.props.params.slug !== nextProps.params.slug){
      
   // Change the state here.... and have Instantsearch take the new slug. 
    }
  }
```

I am not sure if I can provide a working jsbin example or not. If the above description is not clear, I can try to do it.
